# State files. In the container these live on the grounding_runs:/data volume (compose pins
# BRAKE_FEED_STATE_PATH + FALCON_STATE_PATH there). The config defaults are cwd-relative, so a
# local test run against default Settings drops them here as cruft. Never commit them: they are
# runtime state, and the feed watermark records live honeypot destination counts.
brake-feed-state.json
brake-feed-state.json.tmp
